# =============================================================================
# BASELINE: High-Frequency Failed Login Detection (Rate-Based)
# =============================================================================
# Author      : Shankar Baral
# Purpose     : Identify accounts experiencing more than 10 failed logins
#               within any 5-minute window. Used as a high-confidence
#               brute-force indicator.
# Data Source : WinEventLog:Security
# Event Code  : 4625
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Use Case    : Tunable alert query. Convert to Saved Search + Alert Action
#               to trigger real-time notifications when threshold is breached.
# Thresholds  : > 10 failed logins / 5 minutes per (host, user, IP) combo
# =============================================================================

index=* sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count by _time, ComputerName, TargetUserName, IpAddress
| where count > 10